  concept: "Authored objective: Safe Divider Current.\nAuthored requirement: Safe
    Divider Current current \u2265 8 mA. current \u2264 10 mA. Connection pair Register_Input
    and Register_Output. Conduction required.\nGeneral teaching principle: Resistive
    division depends on the actual network and any connected load; a loaded divider
    is not the same as an unloaded one.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: Sharing a resource between branches changes when another load is connected.
